{"id":"644544","name":"琥珀桃仁","author":"远远lyt","authorId":"1444171","desc":"","cover":"images/644544/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"核桃仁","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"生芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"核桃仁洗干净。","img":"images/644544/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入煮好的开水中。","img":"images/644544/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加点糖和盐煮1分钟。","img":"images/644544/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出入凉水。","img":"images/644544/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入白砂糖蜂蜜油。","img":"images/644544/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"生芝麻洗干净。","img":"images/644544/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒进去。","img":"images/644544/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"拌均匀。","img":"images/644544/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入铺好锡纸的烤盘。","img":"images/644544/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"铺平整，装不下再来另外一盘。","img":"images/644544/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"烤箱预热后200°，15-18分钟。","img":"images/644544/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/644544/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"一定要放凉才脆。","img":"images/644544/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"非油炸更健康。","img":"images/644544/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"1.煮核桃水中加油和盐可以有效去除苦涩味。\n2.烤的时候注意翻面，避免焦糊。\n3.放凉透才可以吃哦。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}